			<h3>Welcome to the new ashrae.org!</h3>
<p><strong>We redesigned our website in February 2018 and locations for files and pages have changed. It seems that what you are looking for is among the items that have moved to a new location.&nbsp;</strong></p>
<p>Below are some tips on how to find what you are looking for:</p>
<ul>
<li>Use the search at the top of the site and input the name of the page or file you seek. Use the filters on the side to narrow your search.</li>
<li>Contact us at <a href="mailto:communications@ashrae.org">communications@ashrae.org</a>.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>
<li><a href="https://www.ashrae.org/about/contact-us/contact-us" title="Contact Us" target rel>View a list of staff </a>that can help you.</li>
<li>If you have landed on this page after searching for a <img style="font-size: 1em;" src="http://ashrae-redesign2017.cloud.prod.iapps.com/Image Library/Global Content/Icons/pdf_icon.png" alt="pdf_icon.png"><span style="font-size: 1em;">&nbsp;PDF,&nbsp; </span><img style="font-size: 1em;" src="http://ashrae-redesign2017.cloud.prod.iapps.com/Image Library/Global Content/Icons/ppt.png" alt="ppt.png"><span style="font-size: 1em;">&nbsp; PPT,&nbsp;</span><img style="font-size: 1em;" src="http://ashrae-redesign2017.cloud.prod.iapps.com/Image Library/Global Content/Icons/word_icon.png" alt="word_icon.png"><span style="font-size: 1em;"> Word document, or </span><img style="font-size: 1em;" src="http://ashrae-redesign2017.cloud.prod.iapps.com/Image Library/Global Content/Icons/page-excel-icon.gif" alt="page-excel-icon.gif"><span style="font-size: 1em;">Excel file in Google, Bing, or another search engine, please enter the filename as shown in the address bar into the search bar on this site to find its new location.&nbsp;</span></li>
</ul>
<p>If you are new to the site, we invite you to watch <a href="https://www.ashrae.org/about/news/announcing-the-new-ashrae-org" title="Announcing the New ashrae.org" target rel>our quick overview</a> that introduces where items are located since the site was redesigned in February 2018.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
